ng 10:35 a.m. Jan 4 local time; elapsed duration is 44 hours 40 minutes. The fare scope is unknown, so it is not established as an all-in or per-traveler comparison with award taxes. This is a cash baseline, not an award alternative.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Consolidated limits: the award leads are date-only summaries, not complete itineraries, and their award cabin labels do not confirm cabin on every leg. Their reported seats are leads to check, not a guarantee of current availability. The search reports partial coverage, including omitted or partially queried results; verify any option and its current terms directly before making plans.\"}]}"
